OL,3,ATrump points to Iran war in midterms
OL,4,Adefeat as Mississippi Senate race goes
OL,5,Ato the wire
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump says it's "largely true"
OL,8,Fthe Iran war is behind his Republican
OL,9,FParty's midterm defeat, after
OL,10,FVice-President JD Vance directly
OL,11,Fcriticised the conflict as "the reason
OL,12,Fwe lost"
OL,14,FMeanwhile, two Senate seats are yet to
OL,15,Fbe called: in Mississippi, the parties
OL,16,Fare locked in an exceptionally tight
OL,17,Frace, while a slow counting process
OL,18,Frumbles on in Alaska
OL,20,FOil prices have fallen below $100 a
OL,21,Fbarrel - to their lowest level in two
OL,22,Fmonths - in the wake of the result
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
