OL,5,Ato the wire
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe fallout comes after Democrats swept
OL,8,Fto victory in the midterms, decisively
OL,9,Fwinning back the Senate and the House
OL,10,Ffrom Republicans - see the results in
OL,11,Fmaps
OL,13,FWhat might Trump do next? And how could
OL,14,Fhe thwart Democrats' ambitions in
OL,15,FCongress? BBC Verify explains
